  "limitations": [
    "Frozen official simulator and OFA extractor plus 20+1 project linear head; not full OFA pretraining or exact paper reproduction.",
    "1024 distinct real train groups, balanced across ten semantics and eight fixed random architectures; class-frequency pilot budget fixed without evaluation tuning.",
    "Simulator inputs use existing OFA deterministic center crop256, while the official DAIR demo uses Resize256/RandomCrop256. Outputs remain tensors without image quantization.",
    "Native Python-RNG architecture replay avoids the upstream arch_json shallow-start defect. Source and trace hashes are pinned.",
    "Known-only selection uses fixed20-label Macro-F1 with21-way argmax: unknown predictions count as errors. Threshold fitted only on64 kling calibration examples;63 grok3 unknown evaluation examples.",
    "1-p_unknown is acceptance confidence, not a calibrated origin probability. No real-image detector is trained by this route.",
    "Single seed and exploratory previously inspected parent development roles; no independent test. Official pretraining overlap with IAB is unknown.",
    "All19294 holdout images remain excluded from inference. No source/version-family claims from publisher folder labels.",
    "Wilson intervals treat images as independent; separate group-bootstrap comparison is required for correlated data. OSCR is deferred to score-only comparison."
  ]
